---
description: Architecture
alwaysApply: true
---

Feature-first architecture under `src/`.

src/
  app/
  components/
    common/
    layout/
    navigation/
    cards/
    dialogs/
    forms/
    charts/
    tables/
    feedback/
    ui/
  features/
  hooks/
  services/
  repositories/
  lib/
  providers/
  types/
  constants/
  utils/
  styles/

Business logic belongs in services.
Data access belongs in repositories.
Components remain presentational.
Never call Supabase from UI — Component → Hook → Service → Repository → Supabase.
